&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Level Up Your Career with Zynga!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Zynga, we bring people together through the power of play. As a global leader in interactive entertainment and a proud label of Take-Two Interactive, our games have been downloaded over 6 billion times—connecting players in 175+ countries through fun, strategy, and a little friendly competition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From thrilling casino spins to epic strategy battles, mind-bending puzzles, and social word challenges, our diverse game portfolio has something for everyone. Fan-favorites and latest hits include FarmVille™, Words With Friends™, Zynga Poker™, Game of Thrones Slots Casino™, Wizard of Oz Slots™, Hit it Rich! Slots™, Wonka Slots™, Top Eleven™, Toon Blast™, Empires &amp;amp; Puzzles™, Merge Dragons!™, CSR Racing™, Harry Potter: Puzzles &amp;amp; Spells™, Match Factory™, and Color Block Jam™—plus many more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2007 and headquartered in California, our teams span North America, Europe, and Asia, working together to craft unforgettable gaming experiences. Whether you&#39;re spinning, strategizing, matching, or competing, Zynga is where fun meets innovation—and where you can take your career to the next level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us and be part of the play!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At NaturalMotion, we make games that wow people. We innovate to create previously impossible experiences that would not exist without us. We take pride in making titles that reach a large audience and creating communities that last.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(38, 38, 38)&quot; data-ogsb=&quot;white&quot;&gt;Our commitment to excellence has earned us recognition as one of the UK&#39;s Best Places to Work in games for eight consecutive years by&amp;nbsp;gamesindustry.biz, and we&#39;re proud to be part of the Zynga and Take-Two Interactive family.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NaturalMotion Games are looking for a talented and visionary Lead UI/UX Designer to help shape the player experience for an exciting, unannounced mobile title. This role focuses on steering the end-to-end UX and UI vision, managing a talented design team, and overseeing the entire creative process from early conceptual wireframes to final technical implementation in Unreal Engine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the interface and user flows for our current unannounced project, and future titles, coordinating closely with the Art Director, Design Director, and Product Managers to ensure our UI is visually stunning, accessible, and perfectly aligned with core gameplay pillars. As a live-service game, you will champion futureproof, highly scalable UX design systems and leverage player data and frequent testing to constantly iterate and elevate the user experience during live operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced leader with shipped titles under their belt, a deep mastery of mobile live-ops methodologies, and a genuine passion for mentoring internal and external talent to build a versatile, world-class design team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We embrace a hybrid work environment. Within this role you will work 2 days per week in our London office and the remaining days at home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;UX Vision&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead UX vision for Hacienda and future projects within the studio. Including creating and giving feedback on wireframes, prototypes and design briefs as well as presenting the UX vision to the team and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the design process from concept to implementation, ensuring high standards of quality both in early wireframe and technical implementation in Unreal Engine.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product managers, developers, and other stakeholders to create cohesive and user-friendly designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize data and frequent testing to confirm the effectiveness of UX flows and continue to find areas of improvement throughout development and live operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain design guidelines, standards, and best practices for the team to follow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay updated with industry trends and incorporate new design techniques and tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has strong leadership, creativity, and a deep understanding of user experience and interface design principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;UI Vision&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside the Art Director to ensure UI art style is appealing, accessible and matches the overall Art style of the game.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountable for executing the UI style at quality across all platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Marketing and rendering in presentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Design Director to ensure UX aligns with Design pillars and vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide development of features and systems using deep UX/UI knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure design cohesion and best practices across the team, and communicate them via documentation, presentations, feature reviews and mentoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure efficient, futureproof systems that are built on component re-use rather than bespoke assets and screens.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and provide feedback on UX systems, features, and UI art and provide guidance to other leaders and designers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and manage a team of UI/UX designers both internal and external, providing guidance and mentorship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure team members are on track on their career path, including mentoring, regular one to one’s and creating development plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impart your experience and methods to the team, and leverage their own strengths and backgrounds to build a versatile team capable of tackling any challenge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An experienced UX Lead/Manager/Director with shipped titles under your belt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Mobile development, in particular supporting live-operations, rapid iteration, and agile development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of live-service design methodologies and building a living game for a large community of players.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deeply familiarity with what it takes to develop and ship a live-service title on time and at quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mastery of design systems, workflows, and process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and visual communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer You:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and discretionary annual bonus scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days holiday, plus bank holidays &amp;amp; 2 paid personal days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6 months fully paid maternity/adoption leave and 16 weeks fully paid paternity leave (eligibility criteria applies)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan, with a double matching employer contribution&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical &amp;amp; dental insurance and healthcare cash plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life insurance, personal accident insurance and income protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and neurodiversity support programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company Employee Stock Purchase Plan (eligibility criteria applies)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fitness reimbursement plan, worth £600 per annum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly happy hours, seasonal parties and monthly social events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual rail season ticket advance and cycle to work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal opportunity employer, which means we are committed to creating and celebrating diverse thoughts, cultures, and backgrounds throughout our organization.&amp;nbsp; Employment with us is based on substantive ability, objective qualifications, and work ethic – not an individual’s race, creed, color, religion, sex or gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin or ancestry, alienage or citizenship status, physical or mental disability, pregnancy, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, status as a victim of domestic violence or sex offenses, reproductive health decision, or any other characteristics protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an equal opportunity employer, we are committed to providing the necessary support and accommodation to qualified individuals with disabilities, health conditions, or impairments (subject to any local qualifying requirements) to ensure their full participation in the job application or interview process. Please contact us at ----- to request any accommodations or for support related to your application for an open position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware that Zynga does not conduct job interviews or make job offers over third-party messaging apps such as Telegram, WhatsApp, or others.&amp;nbsp; Zynga also does not engage in any financial exchanges during the recruitment or onboarding process, and will never ask a candidate for their personal or financial information over an app or other unofficial chat channel.&amp;nbsp; Any attempt to do so may be the result of a scamp or phishing attack, and you should not engage.&amp;nbsp; Zynga’s&amp;nbsp; in-house recruitment team will only contact individuals through their official Company email addresses (i.e., via a zynga.com, take2games.com, naturalmotion.com, smallgiantgames.com, themavens.com, gram.gs email domain).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

description_text:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Level Up Your Career with Zynga!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Zynga, we bring people together through the power of play. As a global leader in interactive entertainment and a proud label of Take-Two Interactive, our games have been downloaded over 6 billion times—connecting players in 175+ countries through fun, strategy, and a little friendly competition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From thrilling casino spins to epic strategy battles, mind-bending puzzles, and social word challenges, our diverse game portfolio has something for everyone. Fan-favorites and latest hits include FarmVille™, Words With Friends™, Zynga Poker™, Game of Thrones Slots Casino™, Wizard of Oz Slots™, Hit it Rich! Slots™, Wonka Slots™, Top Eleven™, Toon Blast™, Empires &amp;amp; Puzzles™, Merge Dragons!™, CSR Racing™, Harry Potter: Puzzles &amp;amp; Spells™, Match Factory™, and Color Block Jam™—plus many more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2007 and headquartered in California, our teams span North America, Europe, and Asia, working together to craft unforgettable gaming experiences. Whether you&#39;re spinning, strategizing, matching, or competing, Zynga is where fun meets innovation—and where you can take your career to the next level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us and be part of the play!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;

description_html:
&lt;p&gt;Fospha is the measurement system enterprise retail and ecommerce brands run their business on. We give marketing teams one clear, daily view of what&#39;s actually working — across every channel and everywhere they sell, from their website to Amazon and TikTok Shop — down to the level of a single ad or piece of creative. It replaces guesswork and gut feel with a number marketing, finance and agencies can all trust and act on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brands including Dyson, Gymshark, Adanola and Huel use Fospha up to 25 times a day to decide where budget should move next. We&#39;ve spent over a decade building this, with more than $40 billion in marketing spend now optimised through the platform — and we&#39;re scaling fast across London, Mumbai and Austin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Customer Intelligence team are responsible for ensuring our customers take action on Fospha data: turning data into clear recommendations, guiding marketers through budgeting decisions and helping client teams become experts in the Fospha platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the entry point into the function, and it is a hands-on one. You&#39;ll work across live customer accounts from the point that they go live with Fospha, becoming the trusted expert in the domain, our customers and the decisions they are making across their marketing mix. It&#39;s a role for someone who wants to learn how to turn data into customer action, in a business where these actions are meaningful and exciting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: Customer Intelligence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level&lt;/strong&gt;: Graduate - Entry Level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: London, White City&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll join our Customer Intelligence Team and work across customer accounts, becoming a trusted expert in the insight, model, and data quality that sit behind them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll be responsible for the customer outcomes your team owns — driving action on insight, trust in the model, and confidence in data quality — contributing to customer retention alongside the Account Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll build deep expertise in your specialism and use it to solve real customer problems, turning data into clear recommendations, building trust in our methodology, and keeping data accurate and flowing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll be confident and effective in customer-facing moments relevant to your team, building credibility with both technical and non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll be collaborative, working closely with Account Managers and other specialist teams, feeding customer insight back to Product, and keeping everyone aligned with regular progress updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to your core responsibilities, we expect you to be excited by the opportunity Gen AI brings and find new ways of working utilising our Gen AI hub to increase our efficiency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Centre of Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Centre of Excellence is Fospha&#39;s early-careers programme that develops ambitious, high-performing talent through focused training, hands-on experience and cross-functional exposure. Starting in Customer Intelligence, you&#39;ll gain foundational experience while being prepared for future opportunities across the organisation. The programme operates on the following principles:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Individual Responsibility from the Get-go: You will quickly be responsible for the success of your work, able to make an individual impact early in your career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside SLT at Leading Businesses: You will be engaging with Senior Leadership and C-Level executives at the leading retail brands, getting exposure to how the top companies operate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a Customer Facing Expert: You will be working directly with customers, often meeting them in person and developing your ability to create strong interpersonal relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Exposure: we offer unique opportunities to learn from and collaborate with every department in the business — many daily&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive Training: In addition to the extensive on-the-job learning opportunities, you&#39;ll receive a broad and blended in-person training curriculum covering essential topics such as Business Storytelling, Account Management, Market Research &amp;amp; Product and Financial Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real Mentorship: Regular one-to-ones, feedback, and career conversations with people invested in your progression, not just your output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career Development: High performers have clear opportunities to quickly advance their careers at Fospha — whether progressing within our Customer Teams toward strategic and/or management roles or moving into other departments that align with your skills and interests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern Tools: Hands-on exposure to Gen AI tooling through our Gen AI hub, so you&#39;re building modern, AI-fluent ways of working rather than legacy processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary: £34k + discretionary 10% bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A workplace pension ~~through Royal London~~, with Fospha matching your contributions up to 3%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A £1,000/year flexible benefits allowance to put towards private medical insurance, dental cover, a health cash plan, gym membership, extra holiday, or a pension top-up - whatever suits you!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Wellhub, giving you one membership across gyms, boutique studios, and wellbeing apps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days&#39; annual leave plus 8 UK bank holidays, an extra day off for your birthday! and more holiday the longer you stay (26 days after 3 years, 27 after 6)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance worth 4x your annual salary, from day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to Work scheme, plus discounts on everyday spending through our benefits portal — Apple, Tesco, IKEA, M&amp;amp;S, Deliveroo, cinema tickets and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quarterly one-to-one sessions with a financial adviser, plus access to payroll-deducted loans through Salary Finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid volunteering days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular socials, free weekly snacks, and Lunch &amp;amp; Learn events at our Scale Space office, plus access to the wider Blenheim Chalcot community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to travel — including to our India and North America offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are we looking for?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We hire for potential – you don’t need a technical degree or marketing background. We’re looking for:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, proactive individuals who are keen to learn and grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong relationship-building ability, both internally and externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset, comfortable interpreting data and creating insights – proficiency in Excel!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organised and able to manage multiple priorities simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solving problems for customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in emerging technologies and excited by the potential and opportunity AI brings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values and Principles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be able to demonstrate examples of our core principles:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seek inclusion &amp;amp; diversity: We create an environment where everyone feels welcome, and people are encouraged to speak and be hear&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work Hard, Work Well, Work Together: We take responsibility for making things happen, independently and together; we help colleagues in need and close loops, making sure our work is complete and has lasting impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow: We are proactive, curious and unafraid of failure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer at the heart: We care about the customer, feel their pain and love building product that solves their biggest problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candour with caring: We deliver candid feedback with kindness and receive it with gratitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

