&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As our Talent Acquisition Associate, you get the unique opportunity to be a key player in building the greatest brand within Insurtech. By providing you with the ownership of our recruiting, we want to constantly push you out of your comfort zone ensuring you become an expert. You’ll be working out of our HQ in London and to ensure a never-ending growth curve, we provide you with:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
