&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ready for your next move at ASM?&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You already know what makes ASM special: our people, our purpose, and our passion for innovation. Now’s your chance to grow your career from the inside, take on new challenges, and shape&amp;nbsp;what’s&amp;nbsp;next with us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
