&lt;p&gt;We are Datadog&#39;s in-house product experts. The Technical Solutions team enables Datadog&#39;s worldwide growth by educating potential clients and ensuring that existing customers are happy and successful. We share our technical and product expertise with customers via multi-channel technical support, demos, and presentations. You’ll be joining a team and company where you will be challenged, but also will immediately witness your contributions to Datadog.&lt;/p&gt;
